      "w": 1700,
      "text": "TEN A-FRAMES \u2014 the plan\n\nEach board does ONE job. The headline carries from about 20 feet; the address, the QR and the small print are for someone who has already stopped.\n\nWAYFINDING (3)\n1. Courts & Check-In\n2. Bar & Grill\n3. Private Event Space\n\nOFFERS (4)\n4. Fall Membership\n5. Free Pickleball\n6. Open Play\n7. Lessons & Clinics\n\nDESTINATION & INFO (3)\n8. Paddle Down Pub\n9. Kids Play Free\n10. Opening Hours\n\nAll ten: 24in x 36in portrait, drawn at 96 px per inch (2304 x 3456)."
    },
